侯宗室集議，莫敢難，獨竇嬰爭之，由此與錯有卻。錯所更令三十章，諸侯皆諠譁疾鼂錯。錯父聞之，從潁川來，謂錯曰：「上初即位，公為政用事，侵削諸侯，別疏人骨肉，人口議多怨公者，何也？」鼂錯曰：「固也。不如此，天子不尊，宗廟不安。」錯父曰：「劉氏安矣，而鼂氏危矣，吾去公歸矣！」遂飲藥死，曰：「吾不忍見禍及吾身。」死十餘日，吳楚七國果反，以誅錯為名。及竇嬰、袁盎進說，上令鼂錯衣朝衣斬東市。","source_term":"錯父聞之"}],"interpretation_note":"本篇明示父子；未具名者只留來源身分。太子不推為長子，分支字母不表示出生排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false}}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-shiji-101-yuanchao","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-101","chapter_id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao","raw_mention_count":2,"mention_ids":["c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m019-0072","c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m019-0144"],"paragraph_ids":["c-shiji-101-yuanchao:p019"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m019-0072","mention_ids":["c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m019-0072"],"kind":"paragraph"},{"canonical_mention_id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m019-0144","mention_ids":["c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m019-0144"],"kind":"paragraph"}],"mention_count":2,"duplicate_mention_count":0,"paragraph_occurrence_count":2,"table_occurrence_count":0,"passage_count":1,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers_not_independent_witness_passages","count_explanation":"2處獨立位置，2個原始錨點；0項為同底本同位置重出。頻次不是來源權威度。"}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-shiji-101-yuanchao"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"independent_fixed_witness_occurrences","raw_mentions_preserved":true,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers","explanation":"頻次依已驗同底本同位置去重；原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[{"id":"a-shiji101-008","subject_person_id":"04u_gq0_nke_A","predicate":"father","object_person_id":"04u_gq0_nke","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao","source_id":"s-shiji-101-yuanchao","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:p019","quote":"遷為御史大夫，請諸侯之罪過，削其地，收其枝郡。奏上，上令公卿列侯宗室集議，莫敢難，獨竇嬰