錯有卻。錯所更令三十章，諸侯皆諠譁疾鼂錯。錯父聞之，從潁川來，謂錯曰：「上初即位，公為政用事，侵削諸侯，別疏人骨肉，人口議多怨公者，何也？」鼂錯曰：「固也。不如此，天子不尊，宗廟不安。」錯父曰：「劉氏安矣，而鼂氏危矣，吾去公歸矣！」遂飲藥死，曰：「吾不忍見禍及吾身。」死十餘日，吳楚七國果反，以誅錯為名。及竇嬰、袁盎進說，上令鼂錯衣朝衣斬東市。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m019-0026","start":26,"end":27,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m019-0028","start":28,"end":34,"surface":"公卿列侯宗室","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、學說合稱、典故或待辨匿名指代，未補成員及姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m019-0042","start":42,"end":44,"surface":"竇嬰","kind":"person","person_id":"nuf_tb9_fjs_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m019-0050","start":50,"end":51,"surface":"錯","kind":"person","person_id":"04u_gq0_nke_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m019-0054","start":54,"end":55,"surface":"錯","kind":"person","person_id":"04u_gq0_nke_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m019-0068","start":68,"end":70,"surface":"鼂錯","kind":"person","person_id":"04u_gq0_nke_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m019-0071","start":71,"end":72,"surface":"錯","kind":"person","person_id":"04u_gq0_nke_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m019-0072","start":72,"end":73,"surface":"父","kind":"person","person_id":"04u_gq0_nke","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m019-0082","start":82,"end":83,"surface":"錯","kind":"person","person_id":"04u_gq0_nke_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m019-0086","start":86,"end":87,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m019-0120","start":120,"end":122,"surface":"鼂錯","kind":"person","person_id":"04u_gq0_nke_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m019-